  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{食料|しょくりょう}→食料：03250_shokuryou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{買|か}い{込|こ}む: to stock up on food\n- ⟦{大量|たいりょう}→大量：03112_tairyou⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{買|か}い{込|こ}む: to buy in bulk\n- {買|か}い{込|こ}んでおく: to stock up in advance\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{買|か}いだめ→買いだめ：08047_kaidame⟧: stockpiling — buying ahead against a shortage or a price rise, a noun and ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ verb\n- ⟦{買|か}い{占|し}める→買い占める：15550_kaishimeru⟧: to buy up all of something, leaving none for others",
